#: ../../source/users/project/project_underlying_directory.rst:5
msgid "Open project underlying directory"
msgstr "打开项目基础目录"

#: ../../source/users/project/project_underlying_directory.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the feature of opening the directory where a opened "
"project was saved from the user interface, without the need to look for the "
"directory locally."
msgstr "QElectroTech提供了打开目录的功能，其中打开的项目从用户界面中保存下来，无需在当地查找目录。"

#: ../../source/users/project/project_underlying_directory.rst:10
msgid "To open the underlying directory of a project:"
msgstr "要打开项目的基本目录："

#: ../../source/users/project/project_underlying_directory.rst:12
msgid ""
"Right click on the opened `project`_ from which the underlying directory is "
"desired from the `projects panel`_ tree."
msgstr "右键点击打开的 `项目 <project_>`_，从 `项目面板 <projects panel_>`_ 树中需要从其中获取基本目录 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/project_underlying_directory.rst:13
msgid ""
"Select **Open the underlying directory** to open the local directory where "
"the `project`_ was saved."
msgstr "选择 **打开基础目录** 打开保存 `项目 <project_>`_ 的本地目录 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/project_underlying_directory.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project options in projects panel"
msgstr "图：项目小组中的QElectroTech项目选项"

#: ../../source/users/project/project_underlying_directory.rst:22
msgid ""
"If the `projects panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Projects**."
msgstr "如果 `项目面板 <projects panel_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 项目** 显示。"
